:: Morning Routine [interaction scene] {"position":"275,1900","size":"100,100"}
/* The morning routine (STAGE1_PROPOSAL.md 5.6), unlocked by The Crawl ($mom.flags.morningRoutine): she brings my coffee in
   the morning, and that with it. It replaces the old wake-up with coffee (Morning Wakeup): Activity Sleep offers it as the
   way to wake up, with a "Not this morning" link next to it to skip it. Not during The Silence (setup.morningRoutineReady
   in Define NPCs). Once sex is part of the routine, a separate passage takes over from this one.

   This passage only picks the variant and includes it. Every variant ends with <<include "Morning Routine End">>
   (the stat changes, the counter $mom.flags.morningRoutines and the way out).
     Morning Routine First               the first time: I am asleep when she comes in, and she starts anyway
     Morning Routine Weekday 1 / 2 / 3   dressed for work, against the clock. By her corruption stage (1 to 3)
     Morning Routine Weekend 1 / 2 / 3   her robe, two mugs, slow, she stays
     Morning Routine Near Miss Weekday   $sister.callName knocks and talks through the door
     Morning Routine Near Miss Weekend   $sister.callName opens the door and steals the second mug
   A near miss needs $sister.callName at home (not in my room) and is a 1 in 4 roll from the second morning on. Her
   corruption stage only changes the text there. Both near misses change a line or two once $sister.callName is past
   Everything (sister_everything), because then she has her own reasons to come to my door.

   Media, all in images/characters/mom/events/morning wakeup/ (the comment above each <<Video>> says what the text
   around it assumes):
     morning_blowjob_0_0 to _7.mp4                             the first time (_7 is the only one where I come)
     morning_blowjob_weekday_<stage>_0 to _2.mp4               stage 1 to 3: she comes in, the blowjob, the finish
     morning_blowjob_weekend_<stage>_0 to _2.mp4               the same on the weekend
     morning_blowjob_nearmiss_<weekday|weekend>_0 to _2.mp4    before the interruption, the interruption, the finish */
<<silent>>
<<SetBackground $locations[1].img>>
<<set _mrCount to $mom.flags.morningRoutines || 0>>
<<set _mrWeekend to $date.today.value >= 5>>
<<set _mrStage to Math.clamp(setup.corruptionStage("mom"), 1, 3)>>
<<set _mrSisterAt to setup.npcNow("sister").location>>
<<set _mrSisterHome to !!(_mrSisterAt and _mrSisterAt.id <= 6 and _mrSisterAt.id != 1)>>
<<set _mrSisterClose to setup.questDone("sister_everything")>>
<<set _mrNearMiss to (_mrCount > 0 and _mrSisterHome and random(1, 4) == 1)>>
<<if _mrCount == 0>>
	<<set _mrPassage to "Morning Routine First">>
<<elseif _mrNearMiss>>
	<<set _mrPassage to "Morning Routine Near Miss " + (_mrWeekend ? "Weekend" : "Weekday")>>
<<else>>
	<<set _mrPassage to "Morning Routine " + (_mrWeekend ? "Weekend " : "Weekday ") + _mrStage>>
<</if>>
<</silent>>
<<include _mrPassage>>


:: Morning Routine End [interaction] {"position":"275,2025","size":"100,100"}
/* The end of every morning routine variant, included inside its last reveal step (reads the temporary variables of
   Morning Routine). The first time counts a bit more. A near miss is a little Exhibition for her. */
<<set $mom.flags.morningRoutines to _mrCount + 1>>
<<if _mrCount == 0>>
<<UpdateStat "+" "MomCorruption" 2>>
<<UpdateStat "-" "MomLust" 15>>
<<UpdateStat "+" "MomRelation" 1>>
<<UpdateStat "+" "Corruption" 1>>
<<else>>
<<UpdateStat "+" "MomCorruption" 1>>
<<UpdateStat "-" "MomLust" 10>>
<<UpdateStat "+" "MomRelation" 1>>
<<if _mrNearMiss>><<UpdateStat "+" "MomExhibition" 1>><</if>>
<</if>>

[[Get up|Bedroom]]


:: Morning Routine First [interaction] {"position":"400,1900","size":"100,100"}
/* The first morning I let her in after The Crawl. I told her she'd do it "before I'm even out of bed", and she took me at
   my word: I'm asleep when she comes in. She has put on a new dress for it, the way she wore the navy one at the office.
   Her thanks come at breakfast (meal crawl_thank_you, which describes this morning in one line, keep the two in step).
   The clips are morning_blowjob_0_0 to _7, all from my pillow. The comment above each one says what is in it, so the text
   around it can be checked against the clip. */
/* morning_blowjob_0_0 (23s): I half open my eyes, blurry, the white duvet in front of me. She stands at the foot of the bed
   in a fitted, sleeveless coral dress down to her knees with a slit in front, her face out of frame, hands on her hips,
   smoothing the dress. She turns toward the tall black-framed mirror. My eyes slide back to the pillow and the picture goes
   black: I doze off again */
<<Video "images/characters/mom/events/morning wakeup/morning_blowjob_0_0.mp4" "" "" 600>>

I come up out of sleep for a second, maybe less. There's gray light at the edge of the curtains, the smell of coffee from somewhere close by, and somebody standing at the foot of my bed.

It's $mom.callName, in a dress I've never seen before: coral, sleeveless, fitted all the way down to her knees, with a slit up the front. She smooths it over her hips with both hands, and then she turns to the mirror on my closet door and looks at herself in it, a little sideways, the way she checks herself before a client meeting, except that this is my bedroom and it can't be much past six.

I think I mean to ask her where she's going. I don't get that far before the pillow wins.

<<linkreplace "Drift off again">>
The second time, it isn't the coffee that wakes me.

/* morning_blowjob_0_1 (67s): black, then I wake up again, blurry. She's already bent over me between my legs, still in the
   coral dress, her blonde hair falling forward on both sides, one hand around me and her mouth on me. Near the end she sits
   up, pulls the dress down off her shoulders to her waist (a black push-up bra underneath), lays one hand on her chest and
   keeps stroking me with the other */
<<Video "images/characters/mom/events/morning wakeup/morning_blowjob_0_1.mp4" "" "" 600>>

The blanket is gone, folded back to the end of the bed, and she's between my knees, still in the coral dress, bent over me with her hair hanging down on both sides like a curtain. For a moment all I can see of her is her hand, her mouth and a whole lot of blonde.

<<silently>>
<<set _msgs = [
{ who: $mom, text: "Shh, no, stay right where you are, sweetie. You don't have to do a thing. Your coffee's on the nightstand and it's still hot, I just made a fresh pot, so whenever you feel like..." },
{ text: "She loses the end of the sentence and doesn't go looking for it." },
{ who: $player, text: "What time is it?" },
{ who: $mom, text: "Early. You said before you're even out of bed, honey, and you know me, I take instructions very literally." },
{ who: $player, text: "What's with the dress?" },
{ who: $mom, text: "Oh, this. I bought it for a garden party two summers ago and then I lost my nerve and wore the navy one, and it's been sitting in the closet with the tags on ever since. And I thought, well, if I'm going to be doing this every morning for the rest of... I thought I should at least look nice the first time. Is that silly?" },
{ who: $player, text: "It's not silly." },
{ text: "She looks so pleased that she has to hide her face again, and there's only one place to hide it." },
]>>
<</silently>>
<<Chat _msgs>>

After a while she sits up and peels the dress down off her shoulders, all the way to her waist. Underneath there's a black push-up bra, the going-out kind, which I'd have bet money she didn't own. She keeps one hand on me the whole time and lays the other flat against her chest, as if she's checking her own heartbeat.

Then the bra goes, and the dress after it, and she folds them. She actually folds them and lays them over my desk chair before she climbs back onto the bed. She'd fold the towels on a sinking ship.

<<linkreplace "Lie back">>
/* morning_blowjob_0_2 (10s): naked now, she lies on her stomach between my legs, propped on her forearms, chin near my
   thigh, smiling up at me with her hand cupping my balls. White pillows, a dark headboard, blinds behind her */
<<Video "images/characters/mom/events/morning wakeup/morning_blowjob_0_2.mp4" "" "" 600>>

She stretches out on her stomach between my legs, propped up on her forearms with her chin almost on my thigh, like somebody lying on a beach towel with a good magazine, and smiles up at me.

That's the part I wasn't ready for. At the office, on her knees on the carpet, she spent most of it looking like she might start crying at any moment, and only laughed at the very end, from relief. This morning she looks like she's having a lovely time from the start.

<<silently>>
<<set _msgs = [
{ who: $player, text: "Did you set an alarm for this?" },
{ who: $mom, text: "Five-fifty. I did my hair and my makeup and everything, honey, and then I took one look at you sleeping there and thought, well, he's not going to notice my hair." },
{ who: $player, text: "I noticed the dress." },
{ who: $mom, text: "You did, didn't you?" },
{ text: "She looks absurdly happy about it." },
]>>
<</silently>>
<<Chat _msgs>>

/* morning_blowjob_0_3 (15s): her tongue out, licking up the length of me with her eyes on mine, then taking me in her
   mouth. At the end she pushes her hair back from her face */
<<Video "images/characters/mom/events/morning wakeup/morning_blowjob_0_3.mp4" "" "" 600>>

She takes her time with it and watches me the whole way, and whenever her hair gets in the way she pushes it back with a quick, impatient flick of her hand, the same one she uses in the kitchen when she's got flour on her fingers.

<<linkreplace "Watch her">>
/* morning_blowjob_0_4 (8s): she strokes me with one hand, grinning at me, and tucks her hair behind her ear */
<<Video "images/characters/mom/events/morning wakeup/morning_blowjob_0_4.mp4" "" "" 600>>

<<silently>>
<<set _msgs = [
{ who: $mom, text: "Is this all right? You'd tell me, wouldn't you, sweetie, if I was doing it wrong? Because I lay awake half the night thinking about it, and I wasn't sure if I should..." },
{ who: $player, text: "You're not doing it wrong." },
{ who: $mom, text: "Well, good. Good. I didn't think so, but you never really know with these things, do you?" },
{ text: "She tucks her hair behind her ear, very satisfied with herself, and goes back to it." },
]>>
<</silently>>
<<Chat _msgs>>

/* morning_blowjob_0_5 (27s): she pushes up on her elbows and takes me deeper and slower, a hand on my thigh, now and then
   one hand in her own hair */
<<Video "images/characters/mom/events/morning wakeup/morning_blowjob_0_5.mp4" "" "" 600>>

<<if _mrSisterHome>>
Down the hall a door opens, and the bathroom fan starts up. $mom.callName goes completely still with her eyes on my door, listening with her whole body, and I can feel her pulse in the hand she has on my thigh. Then the shower comes on. She lets her breath out through her nose, very slowly, and when she starts again she takes me deeper than before, as if the scare has made up her mind for her.
<<else>>
Outside, somebody's car won't start. It tries again, and again, and gives up. $mom.callName pushes herself up on her elbows and takes me deeper, slowly, and doesn't even glance at the window.
<</if>>

/* morning_blowjob_0_6 (13s): faster, her hand working me, her tongue out, grinning up at me, her hair swept over one shoulder */
<<Video "images/characters/mom/events/morning wakeup/morning_blowjob_0_6.mp4" "" "" 600>>

Then she's faster, her hair swept over one shoulder and her hand working me, and she's grinning up at me with her tongue out, the way you grin at someone across a room full of people when the two of you know something nobody else does.

<<linkreplace "Let go">>
/* morning_blowjob_0_7 (63s, the only clip where I come): slow again, her cheek almost on my thigh, one hand spread on my hip,
   her eyes on me. I come at the end; she pulls back out of breath, laughing with her tongue out, and smiles up at me */
<<Video "images/characters/mom/events/morning wakeup/morning_blowjob_0_7.mp4" "" "" 600>>

She slows down again on purpose. She lays her cheek almost on my thigh, spreads one hand over my hip as if she's keeping me in place, and watches me, and she doesn't let me hurry it. When I finally come she keeps me in her mouth through all of it. Then she pulls back, out of breath, and laughs with her tongue still out, the way she laughs when a soufflé actually rises.

She sits up, wipes the corner of her mouth with her thumb and pulls the blanket back up over me, all the way to my chin, and tucks it in at the sides.

<<silently>>
<<set _msgs = [
{ who: $mom, text: "Good morning, honey." },
{ text: "She says it as if she's just walked in, as if a mug of coffee and a good morning is the whole of what's happened, and maybe for her it is." },
{ who: $player, text: "Morning." },
{ who: $mom, text: "Now drink that while it's hot. Well, it was hot. It's warm, it's still perfectly... it's very drinkable, sweetie." },
]>>
<</silently>>
<<Chat _msgs>>

She collects the folded dress from my chair, holds it against her chest and slips out the door. A minute later I hear her on the stairs, humming.

The coffee is lukewarm. I drink all of it.

<<ProfileMemory $mom "Before I was even out of bed" "The first morning after the office she came in while I was still asleep, in a coral dress she'd bought two summers ago and never dared to wear, and started without me. I woke up twice, once to her checking herself in my mirror and once to her already at it. She smiled the whole time. Afterwards she tucked me in and said good morning.">>
<<include "Morning Routine End">>
<</linkreplace>>
